  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 0. Setup per rep (Task 0)\n\nGT basis and generators `JJ`, exact sparse monodromy (Lax L_ij = (x-theta_s) delta_ij + h E_ij, twist on the right, quantum minors with k-th factor at x-(k-1)h), quantum-determinant check, then the d1^2 eigenstates of the twisted chain (weight sectors, joint diagonalisation of t1 + pi t2 at x = 3/7 in prec 60, eigenvalue polynomials t_a(u) by 7-point interpolation, residual at an eighth point), dual Q's Q^j(x) = z_j^(x/h) q^j(x) (monic q^j of degree mu_j - L lambda3 from the dual Baxter equation, null space), ladder values `vm[state, site, m]` = v(theta_s + m h), the physical-space Gauss factors P_phys, x0 = (e1 P_phys^-1) tensor 2 and the companion-frame kets (P^-1 tensor P^-1) psi.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Quiet[ClearAll[\"Global`*\"]];\n(* GT basis and gl(3) generators (plain, exact rationals), verbatim from the clean L=1 notebook *)\nps[rep_] := ps[rep] = Block[{res = (Prepend[rep, #1] &) /@ Tuples[Table[Range[rep[[1, i + 1]], rep[[1, i]]], {i, 1, Length[rep[[1]]] - 1}]]}, If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse[Sort[res]], Reverse[Sort[Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]]]];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := Jm[k][pat] = Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] := JJ[k, l, rep] = Which[\n  k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]],\n  l == k + 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l == k - 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l > k + 1, JJ[k, k + 1, rep] . JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - JJ[k + 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k + 1, rep],\n  l < k - 1, JJ[k, k - 1, rep] . JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - JJ[k - 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k - 1, rep]];\nchecks = <||>; tims = <||>;\n(* the ONLY rep switch is the next line *)\nΛ = {2, 1, 0}; nL = 2; d1 = dim[Λ]; d2 = d1^nL;\nhN = 1/2; thN = {2/7, -3/5}; zN = {3/2, 5/4, 2/3}; prec = 60;\ntPar = (thN[[1]] - thN[[2]])/hN;\nid1 = IdentityMatrix[d1, SparseArray]; id2 = IdentityMatrix[d2, SparseArray];\nEe[i_, j_] := Ee[i, j] = SparseArray[JJ[i, j, Λ]];\nE1[i_, j_] := E1[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[Ee[i, j], id1]; E2[i_, j_] := E2[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[id1, Ee[i, j]];\nwtL1 = Table[Table[J0[k][p], {k, 3}], {p, ps[{Λ}]}];\nwtBasis = Flatten[Table[wtL1[[i]] + wtL1[[j]], {i, d1}, {j, d1}], 1];\nuv[n_] := UnitVector[d1, n]; e1 = uv[1];\n(* exp of a nilpotent matrix: finite sum (MatrixPower[nilpotent, 0] errors) *)\nnexp[A_] := id1 + Sum[MatrixPower[A, k]/k!, {k, 1, 2 (Λ[[1]] - Λ[[3]])}];\nnuP[n_][x_] := Product[x - thN[[s]] + hN Λ[[n]], {s, nL}];\n(* exact sparse transfer matrices: Lax L_ij = (x - theta_s) delta_ij + h E_ij, twist M on the right, quantum minors with k-th factor at x-(k-1)h *)\nlax1[s_, x_] := Table[KroneckerDelta[i, j] (x - thN[[s]]) id1 + hN Ee[i, j], {i, 3}, {j, 3}];\nlax2[x_] := lax2[x] = With[{L1 = lax1[1, x], L2 = lax1[2, x]}, Table[Sum[KroneckerProduct[L1[[i, k]], L2[[k, j]]], {k, 3}], {i, 3}, {j, 3}]];\ntwistR[T_, M_] := Table[Sum[T[[i, l]] M[[l, j]], {l, 3}], {i, 3}, {j, 3}];\nmono2[M_][x_] := mono2[M][x] = twistR[lax2[x], M];\nqmin[M_][rI_, cJ_][x_] := Sum[Signature[σ] Dot @@ Table[mono2[M][x - (k - 1) hN][[σ[[k]], cJ[[k]]]], {k, Length[cJ]}], {σ, Permutations[rI]}];\ntL2[a_, x_, M_] := tL2[a, x, M] = Sum[qmin[M][rows, rows][x], {rows, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\nZd = DiagonalMatrix[zN]; Id3 = IdentityMatrix[3]; χ3z = Times @@ zN;\nzeroM[m_] := Union[Flatten[Normal[m]]] === {0};\n{tims[\"setup t_a\"], checks[\"qdet: t3(x) = chi3 nu1(x) nu2(x-h) nu3(x-2h) (exact, x = 3/7)\"]} = AbsoluteTiming[zeroM[tL2[3, 3/7, Zd] - χ3z nuP[1][3/7] nuP[2][3/7 - hN] nuP[3][3/7 - 2 hN] id2]];\nGrid[{{\"Λ\", Λ}, {\"dims (one site, two sites)\", {d1, d2}}, {\"HW pattern = index 1\", ps[{Λ}][[1]]}, {\"(h, θ, z, t = θ12/h)\", {hN, thN, zN, tPar}}, {\"quantum determinant exact\", checks[\"qdet: t3(x) = chi3 nu1(x) nu2(x-h) nu3(x-2h) (exact, x = 3/7)\"]}, {\"time (s)\", tims[\"setup t_a\"]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* eigenstates of the twisted chain: weight sectors, joint diagonalisation of t1 + pi t2 at x = 3/7 (prec 60); eigenvalue polynomials by 7-point interpolation (degree 2a <= 6) *)\nuPts = 1/7 + Range[0, 6]/3;\n{tims[\"numeric t_a at 7 points\"], tNum} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[N[tL2[a, uPts[[k]], Zd], prec], {a, 3}, {k, 7}]];\nmixN = N[tL2[1, 3/7, Zd], prec] + N[Pi, prec] N[tL2[2, 3/7, Zd], prec];\nsecList = GatherBy[Range[d2], wtBasis[[#]] &];\n{tims[\"eigensystems per sector\"], states} = AbsoluteTiming[Flatten[Table[With[{es = Eigensystem[Normal[mixN[[sec, sec]]]]}, Table[<|\"mu\" -> wtBasis[[sec[[1]]]], \"ev\" -> es[[1, r]], \"vec\" -> Normal[SparseArray[Thread[sec -> es[[2, r]]], {d2}]]|>, {r, Length[sec]}]], {sec, secList}], 1]];\nnS = Length[states]; muS = states[[All, \"mu\"]]; vecS = states[[All, \"vec\"]];\n(* a state is a trusted eigenvector only if the three t_a polynomials reproduce it at an eighth point *)\nlamPts[ψ_] := With[{k = Ordering[Abs[ψ], -1][[1]]}, Table[(tNum[[a, j]] . ψ)[[k]]/ψ[[k]], {a, 3}, {j, 7}]];\npolyOf[vals_] := Expand[Sum[vals[[k]] Product[(u - uPts[[l]])/(uPts[[k]] - uPts[[l]]), {l, DeleteCases[Range[7], k]}], {k, 7}]];\n{tims[\"eigenvalue polynomials\"], ttS} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[polyOf /@ lamPts[ψ], {ψ, vecS}]];\ntX = Table[N[tL2[a, 19/23, Zd], prec], {a, 3}];\nresEig = Table[Max[Table[Norm[tX[[a]] . vecS[[A]] - (ttS[[A, a]] /. u -> 19/23) vecS[[A]]], {a, 3}]], {A, nS}];\ngapMix = Min[Table[If[Length[g] > 1, Min[Abs[Subtract @@@ Subsets[states[[g, \"ev\"]], {2}]]], Infinity], {g, GatherBy[Range[nS], muS[[#]] &]}]];\nchecks[\"# states, sector sizes (max), max |t_a psi - lambda_a psi| at x = 19/23\"] = {nS, Max[Length /@ secList], Max[resEig]};\nchecks[\"min gap of mix eigenvalues inside sectors\"] = gapMix;\nGrid[{{\"states, largest sector\", {nS, Max[Length /@ secList]}}, {\"max eigen-residual of t_a at x = 19/23\", N[Max[resEig], 3]}, {\"min eigenvalue gap in sectors\", N[gapMix, 3]}, {\"max |Im ev|\", N[Max[Abs[Im[states[[All, \"ev\"]]]]], 3]}, {\"times (s): numeric t, eigensystems, polynomials\", {tims[\"numeric t_a at 7 points\"], tims[\"eigensystems per sector\"], tims[\"eigenvalue polynomials\"]}}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* dual Q's: Q^j(x) = z_j^(x/h) q^j(x), monic q^j of degree mu_j - L lambda_3 solving the dual Baxter equation (null space at prec 60) *)\nopDual[tt_, Q_, x_] := nuP[3][x] nuP[3][x - hN] nuP[3][x - 2 hN] Q[x + hN] - (tt[[1]] /. u -> x) nuP[3][x - hN] nuP[3][x - 2 hN] Q[x] + (tt[[2]] /. u -> x) nuP[3][x - 2 hN] Q[x - hN] - (tt[[3]] /. u -> x) Q[x - 2 hN];\n(* fixed-degree solve; returns {monic polynomial in X or {}, dimension of the null space} *)\nsolveQdeg[tt_, zz_, d_] := Module[{cq, eqs, ns},\n  eqs = CoefficientList[Chop[Expand[opDual[tt, Function[yy, zz^((yy - X)/hN) Sum[cq[j] yy^j, {j, 0, d}]], X]], 10^-40], X];\n  ns = If[eqs === {}, {UnitVector[d + 1, d + 1]}, NullSpace[N[Table[Coefficient[e, cq[j]], {e, eqs}, {j, 0, d}], prec], Tolerance -> 10^-30]];\n  If[Length[ns] == 0 || Abs[ns[[1, d + 1]]] < 10^-20, {{}, Length[ns]}, {Expand[Sum[ns[[1, j + 1]] X^j, {j, 0, d}]/ns[[1, d + 1]]], Length[ns]}]];\n{tims[\"dual Q's, all states\"], qRes} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[solveQdeg[ttS[[A]], zN[[j]], muS[[A, j]] - nL Λ[[3]]], {A, nS}, {j, 3}]];\nqu = qRes[[All, All, 1]]; quDim = qRes[[All, All, 2]];\nchecks[\"all dual Q's found (deg q^j = mu_j - L lambda3)\"] = FreeQ[qu, {}];\nchecks[\"null space dimension of every Q (all 1?)\"] = Union[Flatten[quDim]];\n(* values on the ladder points: VT[[state, site, m + lambda1 + 2]] = v(theta_s + m h) = (Q^1, Q^2, Q^3) *)\nmPts = Range[-1 - Λ[[1]], 0]; pPts = Length[mPts];\nQU[A_, j_, x_] := N[zN[[j]]^(x/hN), prec] (qu[[A, j]] /. X -> x);\n{tims[\"Q values on ladders\"], VT} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[Table[Table[Table[QU[A, j, thN[[s]] + m hN], {j, 3}], {m, mPts}], {s, nL}], {A, nS}]];\nvm[A_, s_, m_] := VT[[A, s, m + Λ[[1]] + 2]];\n(* Baxter residual relative to the largest term, at x = 19/23 *)\nbaxRes = Table[With[{x = 19/23}, Abs[opDual[ttS[[A]], Function[y, QU[A, j, y]], x]]/Max[Abs[{nuP[3][x] nuP[3][x - hN] nuP[3][x - 2 hN] QU[A, j, x + hN], (ttS[[A, 1]] /. u -> x) nuP[3][x - hN] nuP[3][x - 2 hN] QU[A, j, x], (ttS[[A, 2]] /. u -> x) nuP[3][x - 2 hN] QU[A, j, x - hN], (ttS[[A, 3]] /. u -> x) QU[A, j, x - 2 hN]}]]], {A, nS}, {j, 3}];\nchecks[\"dual Baxter residual (relative, max)\"] = Max[baxRes];\nGrid[{{\"all 3 x nS dual Q's found, null dims\", {checks[\"all dual Q's found (deg q^j = mu_j - L lambda3)\"], checks[\"null space dimension of every Q (all 1?)\"]}}, {\"max relative Baxter residual\", N[Max[baxRes], 3]}, {\"degrees of q^j: min, max\", {Min[Exponent[#, X] & /@ Flatten[qu]], Max[Exponent[#, X] & /@ Flatten[qu]]}}, {\"times (s): Q solve, ladder values\", {tims[\"dual Q's, all states\"], tims[\"Q values on ladders\"]}}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* physical-space Gauss factors P_phys = Pm . diag(s) . Pp (rep-independent group data), the SoV vacuum x0 = (e1 P_phys^-1) tensor 2 and the companion-frame kets (P^-1 tensor P^-1) psi *)\nρdiag[d_] := DiagonalMatrix[Table[Product[d[[k]]^J0[k][p], {k, 3}], {p, ps[{Λ}]}]];\nsVec[zv_] := {zv[[1]]^2/((zv[[1]] - zv[[2]]) (zv[[1]] - zv[[3]])), -(zv[[2]]/(zv[[1]] (zv[[2]] - zv[[3]]))), 1/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]])};\nrVec[zv_] := {-(zv[[3]]/zv[[2]]), -(zv[[3]]/zv[[1]]), (zv[[2]]^2 (zv[[3]] - zv[[1]]))/(zv[[1]]^2 (zv[[2]] - zv[[3]]))};\nPphys[zv_] := nexp[rVec[zv][[1]] Ee[3, 2]] . nexp[rVec[zv][[2]] Ee[3, 1]] . nexp[rVec[zv][[3]] Ee[2, 1]] . ρdiag[sVec[zv]] . nexp[(1/zv[[1]]) Ee[1, 2]] . nexp[-(1/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]])) Ee[1, 3]] . nexp[((zv[[1]] + zv[[2]])/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]])) Ee[2, 3]];\nPph1 = Normal[Pphys[zN]]; PphInv1 = Inverse[Pph1];\nkron[a_, b_] := Flatten[KroneckerProduct[a, b]];\nx01 = e1 . PphInv1; x02 = kron[x01, x01]; x0C = kron[e1, e1];\nx0ovl = Table[x02 . vecS[[A]], {A, nS}];\n{tims[\"companion kets\"], ketC} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[N[Flatten[PphInv1 . Partition[vecS[[A]], d1] . Transpose[PphInv1]], prec], {A, nS}]];\nchecks[\"companion kets: <x0C|ket> = diagonal-frame <x0|psi> (max rel)\"] = Max[Table[Abs[x0C . ketC[[A]] - x0ovl[[A]]]/Abs[x0ovl[[A]]], {A, nS}]];\nchecks[\"<x0|Psi> nonzero (min |.|, not a zero test)\"] = Min[Abs[x0ovl]];\nGrid[{{\"companion kets vs diagonal frame <x0|psi> (max rel dev)\", N[checks[\"companion kets: <x0C|ket> = diagonal-frame <x0|psi> (max rel)\"], 3]}, {\"min |<x0|Psi>| over states\", N[checks[\"<x0|Psi> nonzero (min |.|, not a zero test)\"], 4]}, {\"time (s)\", tims[\"companion kets\"]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
