  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Task 0 results (2026-10-10; three runs of cells 3-6)\n\n| check | [2,1,0] (dim 8, 64 states) | [3,1,0] (dim 15, 225 states) | [3,2,0] (dim 15, 225 states) |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| quantum determinant t3 = chi3 nu1(x) nu2(x-h) nu3(x-2h), exact at x = 3/7 | True | True | True |\n| # eigenstates; largest weight sector | 64; 10 | 225; 18 | 225; 18 |\n| max abs residual of t_a psi = lambda_a(x) psi at x = 19/23 (a = 1,2,3) | < 1e-53 | < 1e-51 | < 1e-52 |\n| min gap of the (t1 + pi t2) eigenvalues inside a sector; max abs Im | 3.2e-3; 0 | 6.4e-3; 0 | 2.1e-2; 0 |\n| all 3 x #states dual Q's found at deg q^j = mu_j - L lambda3 (null-space dimension) | True (1) | True (1) | True (1) |\n| degrees of q^j (min, max) | 0, 4 | 0, 6 | 0, 6 |\n| dual Baxter residual at x = 19/23, relative to the largest term (max over states, j) | < 1e-49 | < 1e-47 | < 1e-48 |\n| <x0C|ket> (companion) equals the diagonal-frame <x0|psi>, max rel dev | < 1e-54 | < 1e-49 | < 1e-51 |\n| min over states of abs <x0|Psi> (nonvanishing, not a zero test) | 1.4e-4 | 4.3e-6 | 4.0e-6 |\n| timings (s): setup + qdet; numeric t at 7 points; eigensystems; eigenvalue polynomials; dual Q's; ladder values; companion kets | 0.02; 0.15; 0.017; 0.25; 0.25; 0.04; 0.016 | 0.12; 0.89; 0.16; 2.7; 1.09; 0.19; 0.30 | 0.13; 0.86; 0.20; 2.7; 1.30; 0.21; 0.31 |\n\nThe whole setup (cells 3-6) takes 5 s (dim 15). Companion kets: ket_C = (P^-1 tensor P^-1) psi_diag, direction as in the adjoint notebook (x0C = e1 tensor e1 gives the diagonal-frame <x0|psi>, check above).",
