  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 6b. Closed-form bracket measures on the loci (added 2026-10-10, later session; Paul's request)\n\nGoal: replace the rational-point decompositions of Task 5 by closed-form wedge vectors F, G as `Factor`ed rational functions of the two free parameters (gA, gC) = (alpha, gamma) on the locus, for [3,1,0] on beta + alpha gamma = alpha^2 (gB = gA^2 - gA gC, cc = 1) and for the adjoint [2,1,0] on the quadric 16 (beta + alpha gamma) = 43 alpha^2 (gB = 43 gA^2/16 - gA gC; the constant 43/16 = (t-3)/(2(t-2)) at t = 62/35 is ccLoc in the code), all (group c2, column c) pairs.\n\nCells: 6b-1 (decomposition, exact, symbolic), 6b-2 (verification: sum of wedges, Task 5 point, all-state overlap identity at fresh points), 6b-3 (structure: slots, supports, delta functions, degrees, constant-vector gauge), 6b-4 (natural-measure test), 6b-5 (t-dependence driver, WIPES Global`; run last) and 6b-6 (its analysis). The cells are rep-generic (`Lambda` switch of cell 3, locus chosen inside cell 6b-1); each was run for [3,1,0] and for [2,1,0] after re-running cells 3-6, 9-10, 13, 16, 19 for that rep (setup 7.6 s ([3,1,0], fresh kernel; 14 s in a busy kernel), 0.9 s ([2,1,0])).\n\n**Conventions.** 2-form of a column A (over the ten minors (n,n'), n < n'): `amat[A]`, wedge (F^G)_{ab} = F_a G_b - F_b G_a, so A = F^G for a rank-2 column, A = sum of wedges for the rank-4 column (Schur complement, rank drops by 2 per step). Pivot (i,j) with A_ij nonzero: **F = A[All, i]/A_ij, G = A[All, j]** (your F = A_{.j}/A_ij, G = A_{.i} gives -A; the sign is absorbed here). **Gauge: F_i = 0, F_j = -1, G_j = 0, G_i = A_ij** (this fixes the F -> s F, G -> G/s and F -> F + c G freedom completely; the amplitude sits in G). **Pivot rule:** among the pivots whose A_ij is a product of gA, gC and the single factor (gA - gC) (= beta/alpha; adjoint: (43 gA - 16 gC)) -- i.e. F, G have poles only on the excluded set alpha beta gamma = 0, never at an interior point of the locus -- the one with the smallest LeafCount of the factored F, G (all admissible pivots are scanned). The cheapest pivot overall, (1,2) in column (0,0) of [3,1,0], has A_12 proportional to gA (2 gA - 3 gC): its F, G blow up at the Task 5 point (-3, -2) (Power::infy in my first run), which is why the rule was added.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Closed-form bracket measures on the locus. Chart b = (1, gA, gB + gA gC); locus gB + gA gC = ccLoc gA^2 ([3,1,0]: ccLoc = 1, t-independent; adjoint: ccLoc = (t-3)/(2(t-2)) = 43/16 at t = 62/35). Free parameters (gA, gC), gB = ccLoc gA^2 - gA gC. Every column 2-form is decomposed EXACTLY and symbolically by Schur-complement steps: pivot (i,j) with M_ij nonzero, F = M[All,i]/M_ij, G = M[All,j], residual M - F^G (rank drops by 2). Gauge: F_i = 0, F_j = -1, G_j = 0, G_i = M_ij (F^G is invariant under F -> s F, G -> G/s and F -> F + c G; this fixes it). All admissible pivots are scanned (see goodPivQ) and the decomposition with the smallest LeafCount of the factored F, G is kept. *)\ncfStall = False;\nccLoc = If[Λ === {3, 1, 0}, 1, (tPar - 3)/(2 (tPar - 2))];\nlocRule = gB -> ccLoc gA^2 - gA gC;\ntog[x_] := With[{r = TimeConstrained[Together[x], 120, $Failed]}, If[r === $Failed, cfStall = True; x, r]];\ncolLoc[c2_, c_] := Expand /@ (colS[c2, c] /. locRule);\nwedgeM[F_, G_] := Table[F[[a]] G[[b]] - F[[b]] G[[a]], {a, pPts}, {b, pPts}];\nzeroMat[M_] := AllTrue[Flatten[M], # === 0 &];\n(* admissible pivot: M_ij nonzero and a product of gA, gC, (ccLoc gA - gC) (= beta/gA) only, i.e. F, G have poles only on the excluded (non-genuine) set alpha beta gamma = 0, never at an interior point of the locus *)\ngoodFacQ[f_] := NumberQ[f] || AnyTrue[{gA, gC, ccLoc gA - gC}, FreeQ[Cancel[f/#], gA | gC] &];\ngoodPivQ[x_] := With[{xt = Together[x]}, AllTrue[Join[FactorList[Numerator[xt]], FactorList[Denominator[xt]]][[All, 1]], goodFacQ]];\nnzPairs[M_] := With[{nz = Select[Subsets[Range[pPts], {2}], M[[#[[1]], #[[2]]]] =!= 0 &]}, With[{gd = Select[nz, goodPivQ[M[[#[[1]], #[[2]]]]] &]}, If[gd === {}, nz, gd]]];\nwedgeStep[M_, p_] := Module[{Fv, Gv, Rm},\n  Fv = tog /@ (M[[All, p[[1]]]]/M[[p[[1]], p[[2]]]]); Gv = M[[All, p[[2]]]];\n  Rm = Map[tog, M - wedgeM[Fv, Gv], {2}];\n  {Fv, Gv, Rm}];\n(* all decompositions (list of {pivot, F, G} per wedge); forced pivots (a list) override the scan *)\ndecompAll[M_, forced_: Automatic] := If[zeroMat[M], {{}}, Flatten[Table[With[{st = wedgeStep[M, p]}, Map[Prepend[#, {p, st[[1]], st[[2]]}] &, decompAll[st[[3]], If[forced === Automatic, Automatic, Rest[forced]]]]], {p, If[forced === Automatic, nzPairs[M], {First[forced]}]}], 1]];\ndecCost[dec_] := LeafCount[Map[Factor, dec[[All, {2, 3}]], {3}]];\nbestDec[M_, forced_: Automatic] := Module[{all = decompAll[M, forced]}, Map[{#[[1]], Map[Factor, #[[2]]], Map[Factor, #[[3]]]} &, First[SortBy[all, {decCost, Length}]]]];\ncolMat[c2_, c_] := amat[colLoc[c2, c]];\n(* pivots used per (c2, c) can be forced from an earlier run (cfPivForced), e.g. to compare two values of t *)\n{tims[\"closed-form decompositions\"], cfDec} = AbsoluteTiming[Association[Flatten[Table[{c2, c} -> bestDec[colMat[c2, c], If[AssociationQ[cfPivForced], cfPivForced[{c2, c}], Automatic]], {c2, 0, Λ[[2]]}, {c, 0, Λ[[2]]}], 1]]];\ncfRankSym = Association[Flatten[Table[{c2, c} -> Length[cfDec[{c2, c}]], {c2, 0, Λ[[2]]}, {c, 0, Λ[[2]]}], 1]];\ncfResid = Table[Count[Flatten[Map[tog, Total[Join[{ConstantArray[0, {pPts, pPts}]}, wedgeM[#[[2]], #[[3]]] & /@ cfDec[{c2, c}]]] - colMat[c2, c], {2}]], x_ /; x =!= 0], {c2, 0, Λ[[2]]}, {c, 0, Λ[[2]]}];\nchecks[\"closed form: exact symbolic residual (# nonzero entries) of sum of wedges - column, all (c2, c)\"] = cfResid;\nGrid[{{\"locus constant ccLoc, locRule\", {ccLoc, locRule}}, {\"# wedges per (c2, c)\", Normal[cfRankSym]}, {\"pivots per (c2, c)\", Normal[Map[#[[All, 1]] &, cfDec]]}, {\"symbolic residual (# nonzero entries of sum of wedges - column; 0 = exact)\", cfResid}, {\"stalled Together (120 s)?\", cfStall}, {\"time (s)\", tims[\"closed-form decompositions\"]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 6b-1 results: closed-form F, G (exact, symbolic; all `Together`/`Factor` instantaneous, 0.07 s, no 120 s guard triggered)\n\nEntries are over the ladder-1 points m = -4, -3, -2, -1, 0 ([3,1,0]) resp. m = -3, -2, -1, 0 ([2,1,0]); (c2, c) = (group, column), c2 = 1 is the vacuum group. Symbolic residual of sum of wedges - column (number of nonzero entries after `Together`, per (c2, c)): **0 for all four pairs, both reps** (so the columns (0,0) and (1,1) of [3,1,0] and all four columns of [2,1,0] are exactly decomposable on the loci, and the 5-point vacuum column (1,0) of [3,1,0] has exactly rank 4 there: two wedges).\n\n**[3,1,0] on gB = gA^2 - gA gC (t = 62/35), 5 wedges in total.**\n\n- (0,0), pivot (1,4): `F = {0, (31*(2*gA - 3*gC))/(12*gA^2*(gA - gC)), (124*(2*gA - 3*gC))/(81*gA*(gA - gC)), -1, 0}`, `G = {(-105*gA^3*(gA - gC))/62, (4515*gA^4*(gA - gC))/248, (1505*gA^5*(gA - gC))/558, 0, 0}`\n- (0,1), pivot (1,2): `F = {0, -1, (-4*gA)/9, 0, 0}`, `G = {(3395*gA)/248, 0, (145985*gA^3)/3348, 0, 0}`\n- (1,0) (vacuum, rank 4), wedge 1 pivot (1,5): `F = {0, -1/43*(27*gA - 62*gC)/(gA^3*(gA - gC)), (58*gA - 93*gC)/(4*gA^2*(gA - gC)), (62*(2*gA - 3*gC))/(27*gA*(gA - gC)), -1}`, `G = {(43*gA^3*(gA - gC))/62, (-129*gA^4*(gA - gC))/62, (129*gA^5*(gA - gC))/62, 0, 0}`\n- (1,0), wedge 2 (Schur complement of wedge 1) pivot (2,4): `F = {0, 0, 0, -1, 0}`, `G = {0, gA^3*(gA - gC), (-129*gA^4*(gA - gC))/8, 0, 0}`\n- (1,1), pivot (1,2): `F = {0, -1, (129*gA)/8, (43*gA^2)/9, 0}`, `G = {1, 0, -41*gA^2, (-344*gA^3)/27, 0}`\n\n**[2,1,0] (adjoint) on gB = 43 gA^2/16 - gA gC (t = 62/35), all four pairs rank 2, 4 wedges.**\n\n- (0,0), pivot (1,3): `F = {0, (31*(43*gA - 32*gC))/(27*gA*(43*gA - 16*gC)), -1, 0}`, `G = {(35*gA^2*(43*gA - 16*gC))/496, (1505*gA^3*(43*gA - 16*gC))/26784, 0, 0}`\n- (0,1), pivot (1,2): `F = {0, -1, 0, 0}`, `G = {(-3395*gA)/1674, 0, 0, 0}`\n- (1,0) (vacuum), pivot (1,4): `F = {0, (2*(27*gA - 62*gC))/(gA^2*(43*gA - 16*gC)), (62*(43*gA - 32*gC))/(27*gA*(43*gA - 16*gC)), -1}`, `G = {-1/124*(gA^2*(43*gA - 16*gC)), (43*gA^3*(43*gA - 16*gC))/992, 0, 0}`\n- (1,1), pivot (1,2): `F = {0, -1, (-16*gA)/27, 0}`, `G = {1, 0, (43*gA^2)/18, 0}`\n\n(The same closed forms for [3,1,0] at general t are in 6b-5/6b-6: every coefficient is a short rational function of t.)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Verification of the closed-form measures. (b) at the rational point of the earlier Task 5 cell: the sum of wedges equals the Task 5 sum of wedges exactly (gauge-free), and the vectors themselves where the pivots coincide; (c) the full overlap identity  <Phi|Psi>/<x0|Psi> M1_vac = sum_c2 lambda2^(c2) sum_c sum_wedges Bk2[F,G] Q^3(theta1 - c h)  on ALL states with the closed-form F, G evaluated at two fresh rational points of the locus (relative deviation, prec 60 data). *)\npt0 = If[Λ === {3, 1, 0}, {gA -> -3, gC -> -2}, {gA -> 4, gC -> 5}];\ntask5 = If[Λ === {3, 1, 0},\n  <|{0, 0} -> {{{0, 0, 0, -1, 0}, {-2835/62, -365715/248, 40635/62, 0, 0}}}, {0, 1} -> {{{0, -1, 4/3, 0, 0}, {-10185/248, 0, -145985/124, 0, 0}}}, {1, 0} -> {{{0, -1, -9, 0, -27}, {43/62, 0, -1161/31, -27, -10449/62}}, {{0, 0, 0, -1, 0}, {0, 0, 8505/8, 0, -729}}}, {1, 1} -> {{{0, -1, -387/8, 43, 0}, {1, 0, -369, 344, 0}}}|>,\n  <|{0, 0} -> {{{0, -1, 828/31, 0}, {-35/9, 0, -276920/837, 0}}}, {0, 1} -> {{{0, -1, 0, 0}, {-6790/837, 0, 0, 0}}}, {1, 0} -> {{{0, -1, 248/909, -368/101}, {-101/31, 0, 172/9, -7912/31}}}, {1, 1} -> {{{0, -1, -64/27, 0}, {1, 0, 344/9, 0}}}|>];\nsumW[wl_] := Total[Join[{ConstantArray[0, {pPts, pPts}]}, wedgeM[#[[1]], #[[2]]] & /@ wl]];\ncfAt[pt_] := Association[Flatten[Table[{c2, c} -> ({#[[2]] /. pt, #[[3]] /. pt} & /@ cfDec[{c2, c}]), {c2, 0, Λ[[2]]}, {c, 0, Λ[[2]]}], 1]];\ncfPt0 = cfAt[pt0];\nchecks[\"closed form at the Task 5 point: sum of wedges = Task 5 sum of wedges (exact, per (c2, c))\"] = Table[sumW[cfPt0[{c2, c}]] === sumW[task5[{c2, c}]], {c2, 0, Λ[[2]]}, {c, 0, Λ[[2]]}];\nchecks[\"closed form at the Task 5 point: identical vectors F, G (same pivots), per (c2, c)\"] = Table[cfPt0[{c2, c}] === task5[{c2, c}], {c2, 0, Λ[[2]]}, {c, 0, Λ[[2]]}];\nbrN[A_, j_, F_] := Sum[F[[i]] vm[A, 1, mPts[[i]]][[j]], {i, pPts}];\nbk2N[A_, F_, G_] := brN[A, 3, F] brN[A, 2, G] - brN[A, 2, F] brN[A, 3, G];\nfreshPts = {{gA -> 5/2, gC -> -3/7}, {gA -> -4/3, gC -> 2/5}};\ncfOverlapDev[pt_] := Module[{gBv, cov, decs, lhs, rhs},\n  gBv = (ccLoc gA^2 - gA gC) /. pt;\n  cov = Normal[gaussCov[{gA /. pt, gBv, gC /. pt}]];\n  decs = Flatten[Table[Map[{c2, c, #[[2]] /. pt, #[[3]] /. pt} &, cfDec[{c2, c}]], {c2, 0, Λ[[2]]}, {c, 0, Λ[[2]]}], 2];\n  lhs = Table[ovlExact[cov, A] sm23[[A, 1, vacL]], {A, nS}];\n  rhs = Table[Sum[facL[A, d[[1]]] bk2N[A, d[[3]], d[[4]]] vm[A, 1, -d[[2]]][[3]], {d, decs}], {A, nS}];\n  {Length[decs], Max[Abs[lhs - rhs]]/Max[Abs[lhs]], Min[Abs[lhs]]/Max[Abs[lhs]]}];\n{tims[\"closed form: state check at fresh points\"], cfDevs} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[cfOverlapDev[pt], {pt, Join[freshPts, {pt0}]}]];\nchecks[\"closed form: overlap identity on all states, relative deviation at the two fresh points and at the Task 5 point\"] = cfDevs[[All, 2]];\nGrid[{{\"states checked\", nS}, {\"fresh locus points\", freshPts}, {\"sum of wedges = Task 5 (exact), per (c2, c)\", checks[\"closed form at the Task 5 point: sum of wedges = Task 5 sum of wedges (exact, per (c2, c))\"]}, {\"identical vectors (same pivots) per (c2, c)\", checks[\"closed form at the Task 5 point: identical vectors F, G (same pivots), per (c2, c)\"]}, {\"{# wedges total, max rel deviation over states, min |lhs|/max |lhs|} at fresh point 1, fresh point 2, Task 5 point\", N[cfDevs, 3]}, {\"time (s)\", tims[\"closed form: state check at fresh points\"]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 6b-2 results: verification of the closed forms\n\n| check | [3,1,0] (locus gB = gA^2 - gA gC) | [2,1,0] (quadric gB = 43 gA^2/16 - gA gC) |\n|---|---|---|\n| (a) symbolic residual of sum of wedges - column, every (c2, c) (exact `Together`, # nonzero entries) | 0, 0, 0, 0 | 0, 0, 0, 0 |\n| (b) Task 5 point (gA, gB, gC) | (-3, 3, -2) | (4, 23, 5) |\n| (b) sum of wedges at the point = Task 5 sum of wedges (exact), (0,0), (0,1), (1,0), (1,1) | True, True, True, True | True, True, True, True |\n| (b) identical vectors F, G (same pivots as the Task 5 cell; the other pairs differ only by gauge/pivot: Task 5 used the first nonzero pivot, e.g. (1,2)+(...) for the vacuum column) | True, True, False, True | False, True, False, True |\n| (c) overlap identity <Phi\\|Psi>/<x0\\|Psi> M1_vac = sum_c2 lambda2^(c2) sum_c sum_wedges Bk2[F,G] Q^3(theta1 - c h), closed-form F, G evaluated at the point; # states; # wedges | 225; 5 | 64; 4 |\n| (c) fresh point 1 (gA, gC) = (5/2, -3/7): max rel deviation over all states (bigfloat zero of accuracy 45.6 resp. 47.9, i.e.) | < 3e-46 | < 2e-48 |\n| (c) fresh point 2 (gA, gC) = (-4/3, 2/5) | < 9e-48 | < 2e-48 |\n| (c) Task 5 point, from the closed form | < 9e-48 | < 2e-48 |\n| guard against a vacuous check: min over states of \\|lhs\\|/max \\|lhs\\| at the three points | 1.2e-7, 6.2e-8, 2.8e-7 | 3.8e-5, 4.6e-7, 4.7e-5 |\n| time (s) for the three points | 0.33 | 0.03 |\n\nThe all-state check uses the saved prec-60 dual Q's (cells 5, 13) and the exact overlap `ovlExact` of cell 13; the deviation is zero to the working accuracy. So the closed forms hold on the 2-dimensional loci, not just at the Task 5 point (deviation at two further points ~ 1e-47).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
