  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 6c-2: gauge-invariant nice-basis tests per column. A = gA^(c) D A0 D with D = diag(gA^m) (uKern), so P = span{F, G} = D P0 and the class vectors gA^m x (...) are D times the m-only vectors: every intersection dimension depends on (sR, tv) = (gC/gA, t) only (hence the loci below live in the (sR, tv) plane). h = 1, theta1 = 0 WLOG (p a polynomial in u = polynomial in m of the same degree; all weights are products of linear factors in m and tv = theta12/h). A 2-form is F^G iff F, G in P; for the rank-4 column (1,0) a decomposition into two wedges needs the whole image in the class. *)\nClearAll[uAm0, uPw, uW5, uW8, uCross, uCls, uClearDen, uInter, uJump, uDeltaInter, uKerOf, uMoeb];\nuAm0[k_] := Table[Which[i == j, 0, i < j, Lookup[uKern[k], Key[{uPts[[i]], uPts[[j]]}], 0], True, -Lookup[uKern[k], Key[{uPts[[j]], uPts[[i]]}], 0]], {i, 5}, {j, 5}];\nuPw[m_, k_] := If[k == 0, 1, m^k];\nuW5[m_] := 1/Product[mp - m, {mp, DeleteCases[uPts, m]}];\n(* global SoV measure over the eight poles theta_s - n h (n = 0..3, s = 1,2) except x_m: ladder 1 gives (m + n) (skipped when it is the point itself), ladder 2 gives (tv + m + n) *)\nuW8[m_] := 1/(Product[-n - m, {n, DeleteCases[Range[0, 3], -m]}] Product[-tv - n - m, {n, 0, 3}]);\nuCross[m_] := 1/Product[tv + m + n, {n, 0, 3}];\nuCls[cls_, d_] := Table[Table[Switch[cls, \"a\", uW5[m] uPw[m, k], \"b\", uW8[m] uPw[m, k], \"c\", uPw[m, k], \"d\", uCross[m] uPw[m, k]], {m, uPts}], {k, 0, d}];\nuClearDen[v_] := With[{den = PolynomialLCM @@ (Denominator[Together[#]] & /@ v)}, Together[v den]];\n(* generic dimension of P cap class = null space of (annihilators of P) . (class vectors); closed-form basis returned *)\nuInter[k_, vecs_] := Module[{ns = NullSpace[uAm0[k]], cond, sol},\n  cond = Together[ns . Transpose[vecs]]; sol = NullSpace[cond];\n  If[sol === {}, {}, Together /@ (sol . vecs)]];\nuDims = Table[Length[uInter[k, uCls[cls, d]]], {k, {{0, 0}, {0, 1}, {1, 0}, {1, 1}}}, {cls, {\"a\", \"b\", \"c\", \"d\"}}, {d, 0, 2}];\n(* locus in the (sR, tv) plane where the dimension jumps: all (rank A + d + 1)-minors of [A | class vectors] (class vectors with denominators cleared), Groebner basis in (sR, tv); {1} = no jump anywhere *)\nuJump[k_, cls_, d_] := Module[{A = uAm0[k], rk, V, r, M, gens},\n  rk = MatrixRank[A /. {sR -> 3/7, tv -> 11/5}]; V = uClearDen /@ uCls[cls, d]; r = rk + d + 1;\n  If[r > 5, Return[\"forced by dimension count\"]];\n  M = Transpose[Join[Transpose[A], V]];\n  gens = DeleteCases[Union[Numerator /@ Together /@ Flatten[Minors[M, r]]], 0];\n  Factor /@ GroebnerBasis[gens, {sR, tv}]];\nuJumps = Association[Flatten[Table[{k, cls, d} -> TimeConstrained[uJump[k, cls, d], 120, $Failed], {k, {{0, 0}, {0, 1}, {1, 0}, {1, 1}}}, {cls, {\"a\", \"b\", \"c\", \"d\"}}, {d, 0, 2}], 2]];\n(* (e) deltas and 2-point vectors inside P *)\nuDeltaInter[k_, idx_List] := Module[{ns = NullSpace[uAm0[k]], V = Table[UnitVector[5, i], {i, idx}], sol},\n  sol = NullSpace[Together[ns . Transpose[V]]]; If[sol === {}, {}, Together /@ (sol . V)]];\nuDeltas = Table[k -> {Select[Table[{uPts[[i]], uDeltaInter[k, {i}]}, {i, 5}], #[[2]] =!= {} &], Select[Flatten[Table[{uPts[[{i, j}]], uDeltaInter[k, {i, j}]}, {i, 5}, {j, i + 1, 5}], 1], #[[2]] =!= {} &]}, {k, {{0, 0}, {0, 1}, {1, 0}, {1, 1}}}];\n(* dual description: annihilators of P (cleared, factored); on the 4-point supports a 2-plane P = wgt_S Pol_1 / nu exists iff the two annihilators are nu Pol_1, i.e. iff the Moebius determinant below vanishes *)\nuKerOf = Association[Table[k -> (Factor /@ (uClearDen /@ NullSpace[uAm0[k]])), {k, {{0, 0}, {0, 1}, {1, 0}, {1, 1}}}]];\nuMoeb[na_, nb_, nodes_] := Factor[Det[Table[{nb[[i]], nb[[i]] nodes[[i]], -na[[i]], -na[[i]] nodes[[i]]}, {i, 4}]]];\nuMoebTab = {uMoeb[uKerOf[{0, 0}][[3, 1 ;; 4]], uKerOf[{0, 0}][[2, 1 ;; 4]], {-4, -3, -2, -1}], uMoeb[uKerOf[{1, 1}][[1, 1 ;; 4]], uKerOf[{1, 1}][[2, 1 ;; 4]], {-4, -3, -2, -1}], With[{B = uAm0[{1, 0}][[{1, 2, 3, 5}, {1, 2, 3, 5}]]}, With[{kb = Factor /@ (uClearDen /@ NullSpace[B])}, uMoeb[kb[[1]], kb[[2]], {-4, -3, -2, 0}]]]};\n(* sanity of the gA-independence: the intersection dimension with the FULL gA-dependent matrix at a random point equals the a-frame one (class (c), d = 2, all four columns) *)\nuFullCheck = Table[With[{pt = {gA -> 5/3, sR -> 2/7, tv -> 13/5}}, Module[{A = uA[tv, gA, sR gA][k] /. pt, V = Table[Table[gA^m uPw[m, kk], {m, uPts}], {kk, 0, 2}] /. pt, ns},\n  ns = NullSpace[A]; Length[NullSpace[ns . Transpose[V]]]]], {k, {{0, 0}, {0, 1}, {1, 0}, {1, 1}}}];\nGrid[{{\"dim P cap class: rows columns (0,0),(0,1),(1,0),(1,1); per class a,b,c,d the d = 0,1,2 values\", uDims}, {\"same with the full gA matrix, class (c) d = 2 (equals the a-frame value)\", {uFullCheck, uDims[[All, 3, 3]]}}, {\"Moebius determinants (0,0) on {-4..-1}, (1,1) on {-4..-1}, (1,0) minus point -1 on {-4,-3,-2,0}\", uMoebTab}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
